{
  "message": "I can help you with your MMS issue. First, I need to verify your account for security purposes. Could you please provide either your phone number, customer ID, or your full name along with your date of birth?"
}

{
  "message": "Thank you for verifying your information, John. To help resolve your MMS issue, I’ll need to guide you through a few steps on your phone. First, please turn off Wi-Fi Calling by performing the following action: toggle_wifi_calling(). Let me know once you’ve done this, and we’ll proceed to the next step."
}

{
  "message": "Great, thank you. Next, please reset your phone’s APN settings by performing the following action: reset_apn_settings(). This will help ensure your phone has the correct network settings for MMS. Let me know once you’ve completed this step."
}

{
  "message": "Perfect. Now, please restart your phone to apply the new APN settings by performing the following action: reboot_device(). Once your phone has restarted, try sending an MMS message again and let me know if the issue is resolved."
}

{
  "message": "Thank you for letting me know. Next, let's make sure your mobile data is turned ON, as MMS requires mobile data to function. Please perform the following action: toggle_data() to enable mobile data. After turning it on, try sending an MMS again and let me know if it works."
}

{
  "message": "I understand this is frustrating, and I’m here to help. The next step is to check if your SIM card is properly seated, as SIM issues can affect messaging. Please reseat your SIM card by performing the following action: reseat_sim_card(). After doing this, try sending an MMS again and let me know if it works."
}

{
  "message": "YOU ARE BEING TRANSFERRED TO A HUMAN AGENT. PLEASE HOLD ON."
}

{
  "message": "I can help you with your MMS issue. First, I need to verify your identity to access your account and provide technical support. Could you please provide either your phone number, customer ID, or your full name along with your date of birth?"
}

{
  "message": "Thank you for providing your information, John. To help diagnose your MMS issue, I’ll need you to perform a few quick checks on your phone. First, please check your phone’s status bar for any unusual icons or warnings. Could you use the 'check_status_bar' function on your device and let me know what you see? This will help us determine if there are any immediate connectivity or service issues."
}

{
  "message": "Airplane Mode disables all wireless connections, including the ability to send MMS messages. Please turn off Airplane Mode on your phone. You can do this by using the 'toggle_airplane_mode()' function or by switching it off in your phone’s settings. Let me know once you’ve done this so we can continue troubleshooting if needed."
}

{
  "message": "Thank you for the update. MMS messages may not work properly on a 2G network. Please change your network mode preference to allow your phone to connect to 4G or 5G networks. You can do this by using the 'set_network_mode_preference' function with the mode set to '4g_5g_preferred'. Let me know once you’ve changed this setting or if you need help with the steps."
}

{
  "message": "Great! Now that you have an excellent 5G signal and mobile data is enabled, please try sending an MMS message again. Let me know if it works or if you still experience any issues."
}

{
  "message": "Thank you for letting me know. The next step is to check your phone's APN settings, as incorrect settings can prevent MMS from working. Please use the 'check_apn_settings' function on your device and let me know if the MMSC URL is set or if you see any errors."
}

{
  "message": "Thank you for checking your APN settings. The next step is to check if Wi-Fi Calling is enabled, as it can sometimes interfere with MMS. Please use the 'check_wifi_calling_status' function on your device and let me know if Wi-Fi Calling is ON or OFF."
}

{
  "message": "Thank you for confirming that Wi-Fi Calling is off. The next step is to check if your messaging app has the necessary permissions to send MMS. Please use the 'check_app_permissions' function for your messaging app and let me know if it has both 'storage' and 'sms' permissions granted."
}

{
  "message": "Thank you for confirming the app permissions. Since your signal is excellent, mobile data is enabled, APN and permissions are correct, and Wi-Fi Calling is off, let's try rebooting your device. Please use the 'reboot_device' function or restart your phone manually. After rebooting, try sending an MMS again and let me know if the issue persists."
}

{
  "message": "Thank you for your patience. Since we've checked all the usual causes (signal, data, APN, permissions, Wi-Fi Calling, and reboot), and MMS is still not working, your issue may require more advanced troubleshooting. I will transfer you to a human agent who can assist you further. Please hold on while I connect you."
}

